  "details": "Description\n\nWhen I pressing 'Y' while chatting, chat UI toggles off. It means every users play this build cannot type 'Y' without copy & paste.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nPress 'Y' while chatting. This causes chatting UI off. Type 'Y' in other field and copy & paste it to chat field for type 'Y' in chat.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 유저 인터페이스\n\n- Frequency: 항상\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1913-a070c3378e-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
